<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND 62-1 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND 62-1 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland, 65 behind Natal on first innings, were 62 for one in their second innings at tea on the second day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Boland 133 and 62-1. Natal 198 (Dale Benkenstein 50; Henry Williams 6-57, David Millns 4-64).</p>
